{"id":1014,"bangumiId":1014,"type":2,"name":"とある魔術の禁書目録","name_cn":"魔法禁书目录","date":"2008-10-04","year":"2008","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/76/6d/1014_nqAH8.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/76/6d/1014_nqAH8.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/76/6d/1014_nqAH8.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/76/6d/1014_nqAH8.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/76/6d/1014_nqAH8.jpg"},"summary":"自己的阳台栏杆上出现了像被单一样挂在上面的少女，这种非现实的情节出现在了上条当麻的眼前。虽然在这个城市——最先进科学引导的学院都市中，超能力已经可以通过科学技术创造出来，但是眼前这位自称“茵蒂克丝”的少女还是把上条当麻吓了一跳。茵蒂克丝自称因拥有十万三千本魔导书而被魔法师追杀，而上条当麻靠自己的超能力也认定了少女的魔法。少女以危险为由离开上条家，上条如往日一般去学校学习，但放学回家，却发现茵蒂克丝倒在血泊之中。在科学与魔术交叉的世界中，上条当麻与茵蒂克丝的故事开始了。","rating":{"rank":3912,"total":16146,"count":{"1":40,"2":41,"3":99,"4":352,"5":1210,"6":4414,"7":6624,"8":2572,"9":490,"10":304},"score":6.7},"collection":{"on_hold":1135,"dropped":657,"wish":1918,"collect":28698,"doing":938},"tags":[{"name":"J.C.STAFF","count":2998,"total_count":139704},{"name":"とある魔術の禁書目録","count":1932,"total_count":2599},{"name":"超能力","count":1639,"total_count":26391},{"name":"2008年10月","count":1515,"total_count":8639},{"name":"魔法禁书目录","count":1493,"total_count":6551},{"name":"TV","count":1384,"total_count":1453954},{"name":"当妈","count":1075,"total_count":1905},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1035,"total_count":511926},{"name":"战斗","count":978,"total_count":493759},{"name":"魔法","count":849,"total_count":20719},{"name":"镰池和马","count":736,"total_count":1063},{"name":"2008","count":711,"total_count":36474},{"name":"index","count":662,"total_count":1067},{"name":"禁书目录","count":489,"total_count":2263},{"name":"超电磁炮","count":483,"total_count":6555},{"name":"奇幻","count":453,"total_count":495956},{"name":"小说改","count":388,"total_count":169395},{"name":"后宫","count":359,"total_count":312950},{"name":"科幻","count":347,"total_count":262198},{"name":"轻改","count":298,"total_count":156600},{"name":"校园","count":263,"total_count":473913},{"name":"日